          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Jadar Rajwadi Jewellery Jadar Rajwadi jewellery is known for its grand appearance, intricate patterns, and decorative craftsmanship. The style reflects a regal aesthetic with elaborate metalwork and colourful stones. The style developed from traditional ornamental craftsmanship focused on luxurious designs and artistic detailing. It is commonly worn during weddings, festivals, cultural celebrations, and ceremonial events because of its bold and decorative appearance. The striking combination of intricate metalwork and vibrant stones helped this style gain widespread admiration. Contemporary designers reinterpret Jadar Rajwadi jewellery using lighter materials and modern forms, making it suitable for both traditional attire and modern fashion styling.</p>",
